    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... i've talked to people but it doesn't change the reality. she's working more hours, the house is falling apart because i can't keep up, and i just see her looking so tired. every single day. it feels like my existence is just this constant subtraction from her life. i hate that i'm the reason she's so exhausted all the time.",
